<Slide style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, background: '#0B1521', padding: 60 }}>
  <Box style={{ position: 'relative', width: '100%', height: '100%' }}>
    <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', top: -120, right: -80, width: 620, height: 620, background: 'radial-gradient(circle, rgba(58,92,188,0.22) 0%, rgba(11,21,33,0) 68%)' }} />
    <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 0, top: 0, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 14 }}>
      <Box style={{ width: 5, height: 20, background: '#63A7D4' }} />
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8FBCE4', letterSpacing: 2 }}>最有价值的那个例子</Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 0, top: 56, width: 1160, flexDirection: 'row', gap: 60 }}>
      <Box style={{ width: 440, flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 200, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#63A7D4', lineHeight: 0.9 }}>↑</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 52, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF', marginTop: 16, lineHeight: 1.15 }}>医生越来越多</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#A9CFE7', marginTop: 16, lineHeight: 1.5 }}>AI 化程度最高的放射科，<br />没有消失，反而扩编了。</Text>
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 26, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF', lineHeight: 1.45 }}>放射科医生的目标从来不是"看片子"，<br /><span style={{ color: '#63A7D4' }}>而是诊断疾病。</span></Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#E7E8E9', marginTop: 22, lineHeight: 1.7 }}>当"看片子"被 AI 变得极其高效，医生能看更多片子、更多模态，花更多时间和病人在一起——结果是全球做的放射检查更多，诊断质量更好。</Text>
        <Box style={{ marginTop: 28, background: '#162534', borderRadius: 8, padding: 24, borderLeft: '4px solid #8ED1A8' }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#8ED1A8', letterSpacing: 1, fontWeight: 'bold' }}>一个可以反复使用的判断工具</Text>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 21, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF', marginTop: 10, lineHeight: 1.45 }}>别问这个岗位每天在做什么，<br />问它最终交付的是什么。</Text>
        </Box>
      </Box>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 0, bottom: 0, width: 1160, flexDirection: 'row', gap: 12, alignItems: 'center' }}>
      <Box style={{ width: 40, height: 1, background: '#63A7D4' }} />
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#A9CFE7' }}>黄仁勋 · 美沙投资论坛 · 2025</Text>
    </Box>
  </Box>
</Slide>
